<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 5.91 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 5.91 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index rose to 5.91 percent in the week ended June 28 from 5.81 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>	 WHOLESALE PRICES  June 28, 97  June 21, 97  June 27, 96</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change     +5.91	  +5.81	  +4.18</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)    324.5	  324.3	 306.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended June 27, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
